; Object state/animation jump-table (used with $B7F6, various offsets)
;
; .
;
; .
;
; One continuous 73-entry word table of code addresses, live-verified: every
; entry ($A000-$A091) points into valid code ($A445-$C3C7 range). Different
; routines index into different sub-ranges of this same table via $B7F6 (e.g.
; $A02A, $A02E, $A038, $A042, $A052, $A076 are all just offsets into it, not
; separate tables). Ends at $A092, immediately followed by the score-value
; table at $A094 (see $66B5).
