; Multi-hit enemy: take damage, retire after hit counter (IY+12) expires
;
; .
;
; .
;
; Handler for indices $2E, $2F of the $A000 jump table (see $B7F6).
; .
; On each hit (IY+14 nonzero), ORs it into the global hit-flag $9C6B and
; decrements a per-object hit counter at IY+12; the object only dies once that
; counter reaches zero (unlike $C015's one-hit projectile). Also handles
; retirement via $B79F when the "alive" flag (bit 1 of IY+4) or "dying" flag
; (bit 4) indicate the object is done.
c$C075 CALL $B8F9      ; Movement-pattern script interpreter
 $C078 BIT 1,(IY+$04)  ;
 $C07C JR Z,$C08C      ;
 $C07E BIT 4,(IY+$04)  ;
 $C082 JR NZ,$C0D4     ;
*$C084 LD HL,$9D18     ;
 $C087 INC (HL)        ;
 $C088 CALL $B79F      ; Mark formation slot done, trigger completion effect
                       ; when group empties
